### domain-reputation API requests
### Requires the "REST Client" VS Code extension (humao.rest-client).
### Run `go run ./cmd/server` first, then click "Send Request" above any block.

@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080
@apiKey = 16aa41b873762469b690c4b6b4a7e691d6c46147f63d76b333cc669ee2844299

### Health check
GET {{baseUrl}}/health

### Readiness (503 until the first IPFire snapshot is published)
GET {{baseUrl}}/ready

### Domain reputation — known domain (score = sum of matching categories)
GET {{baseUrl}}/v1/reputation/domain/robloxr.com.es
X-API-Key: {{apiKey}}

### Domain reputation — normalization (uppercase + trailing dot both resolve the same)
GET {{baseUrl}}/v1/reputation/domain/EVIL.COM.
X-API-Key: {{apiKey}}

### Domain reputation — unknown domain (200 OK, score 0, empty categories)
GET {{baseUrl}}/v1/reputation/domain/example.com
X-API-Key: {{apiKey}}

### Domain reputation — malformed domain (400 Bad Request)
GET {{baseUrl}}/v1/reputation/domain/%2A%2A%2A
X-API-Key: {{apiKey}}

### Score-only endpoint (minimal payload for high-throughput consumers)
GET {{baseUrl}}/v1/reputation/domain/yukthi.com/score
X-API-Key: {{apiKey}}

### Batch domain reputation
POST {{baseUrl}}/v1/reputation/domains
X-API-Key: {{apiKey}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "domains": ["evil.com", "example.com", "bad.com"]
}

### Batch domain reputation — empty list (400 Bad Request)
POST {{baseUrl}}/v1/reputation/domains
X-API-Key: {{apiKey}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "domains": []
}

### Domain reputation — missing/invalid API key (401 Unauthorized)
GET {{baseUrl}}/v1/reputation/domain/example.com
X-API-Key: wrong-key
